flowchart TD
    START(["开始"]) --> INIT{{"初始化 Data_pst 指向<br>Gp_TLF35584_rtData_ltst"}}
    INIT --> READ_CMD[["Gp_TLF35584_ReadCmd<br>读取设备状态寄存器"]]
